        "tab_Pnaqf3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Engraving ideas",
            "content": "<p><strong>- Initials</strong>: A + B or A ♡ B<br/><strong>- Names</strong>: Emma / Ross<br/><strong>- Date</strong>: 05/01/2014<br/><strong>- Roman numerals</strong>: V.XVI.MMXX<br/><strong>- Quotes</strong>:<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;- Forever / and always<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;- I love you / Forever<br/><strong>- Symbols</strong>: ♥ ❤ ♡ ✿ ❀ ✽ ★ ☆ ☘ ☾ ∞<br/>⚠️ Choose simple symbols for a legible engraving.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_RWVKND": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>All our gift boxes also include a gift bag</strong></span><strong>, perfect for gifting and creating an unforgettable moment.</strong></p><p>Our Eternal Bear Gift Box with hidden personalized necklace is a gift that lasts a lifetime. Featuring a real preserved rose that will last forever, this gift is the perfect symbol of eternal love.</p><p>Turn the rose to reveal a handmade necklace personalized with the engravings of your choice.</p><p><strong>Details:</strong><br/></p><ul><li>Certified 316L stainless steel — water-resistant and tarnish-free<br/></li><li>Made with the utmost care</li></ul><p><strong>Engraving:</strong></p><ul><li>Up to 15 characters on each heart</li></ul><p><strong>Quality:</strong></p><ul><li>Hypoallergenic: our jewelry is guaranteed nickel-free, cadmium-free and lead-free.</li><li>Water-resistant and tarnish-free</li><li>Lifetime warranty</li></ul><p><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p><ul><li>Necklace length: 17.3\" + 2\" extender (44 cm + 5 cm)</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_e6czLe": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping",
            "content": "<p>All orders are packed, prepared and shipped within <strong>24–72 hours.</strong></p><p>Every order comes with a tracking number, so you can follow your package every step of the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_7VYzhD": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Money-back guarantee",
            "content": "<p>At <strong>Soraya Paris</strong>, your satisfaction is our top priority. Our goal is to give you an exceptional experience.</p><p>All our products come with a 30-day money-back guarantee. We'll do everything in our power to make sure your experience with <strong>Soraya Paris</strong> is a positive one!<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
